      "mergeID": "6335d970919f3144af09044a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "# Issue:\nWe can finally see if and how many friends are in an instance which is great! But there is one problem, when you are just going through worlds, there is no way for you to see which friends are actually in an Instance.\n# Suggestion:\nI think it would be great if there would be some way to see which friends are actually in an Instance when looking through Worlds.\nI think either allowing us to press on the little friends indicator (might be hard to find), addind a separate Action button to \"View Friends in Instance\" or adding row below the World Details (would mix up World Info with Instance specific Info) would be great!\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see what page I'm talking about:",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1238] Show which Friends are in an Instance (in the Worlds Tab)",
