      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Bump?\n\nIt's been three years. \n\nIs there some weird reason under the hood as to why this is difficult to add?\n\nI feel like this is one of those things that could be fairly easy to implement since the data and everything is (probably) already there and accessible, just hidden away in another tab? (I am just assuming though)\n\nIt would be a really nice QoL change to be able to see who's in the instance directly from this window vs. having to back out -> go to Social -> Friend Instances -> and keep scrolling until you find that one specific instance again, only to find out it's people you don't really feel like talking to right now and you just wasted a bunch of time having to go back and dig.",
